230 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Sailber is a modern cab service brand focused on reliable transportation\054 smart mobility\054 and clean urban travel experiences\056 For this project\054 I was responsible for creating the complete visual identity including logo design\054 social media branding\054 promotional creatives\054 and digital marketing visuals\056 The goal was to build a professional and memorable brand identity that reflects speed\054 trust\054 safety\054 and modern transportation services\056)
